{"id":"633399","name":"野苋菜肉丁包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633399/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"野苋菜","amount":"750g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"400g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大盆里放温水，放酵母溶化。","img":"images/633399/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放面粉揉成面团。","img":"images/633399/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盖起来放一边发酵。","img":"images/633399/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发好的面。","img":"images/633399/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"新鲜五花肉。","img":"images/633399/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切丁，肥肉单独放起来。","img":"images/633399/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"苋菜焯水，过冷水撰干水分。","img":"images/633399/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/633399/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"葱姜切末。","img":"images/633399/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放肥肉。","img":"images/633399/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"㸆出油脂。","img":"images/633399/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放精肉翻炒均匀关火。","img":"images/633399/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放野菜。","img":"images/633399/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/633399/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放生抽和鸡精、椒盐及葱姜末。","img":"images/633399/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/633399/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"发好的面取出来，揉光排气搓成长条。","img":"images/633399/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"揪剂子擀皮。","img":"images/633399/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"包包子。","img":"images/633399/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放蒸笼里二次发酵。","img":"images/633399/step_20.jpeg"},{"step":21,"desc":"这是放肉的，包花纹的是几乎没肉的。","img":"images/633399/step_21.jpeg"},{"step":22,"desc":"发好的包子大火烧开，改中火蒸25分钟焖5分钟。","img":"images/633399/step_22.jpeg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633399/step_23.jpeg"},{"step":24,"desc":"开动。","img":"images/633399/step_24.jpeg"}],"tips":"为了减肥跟老公斗智斗勇，包的漂亮的没放肉，包的丑的放肉，吃饭的时候就跟他说我吃漂亮的，他吃丑的。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t